{
  "info": {
    "name": "REGINSA API Test - Caso 01 Entidad",
    "_postman_id": "5e9a7fd3-9dfa-4eb9-b9ec-8ea260ec7001",
    "description": "Objetivo: validar flujo funcional Caso 01 de alta y controles de duplicidad | Reglas: unicidad de RUC y razon social con rechazo controlado | Exito: alta valida y deteccion de duplicados esperada | Evidencia: assertions Postman y XML Newman del caso",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const now = Date.now();",
          "const rnd = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100000);",
          "const ruc = `2${String(now).slice(-8)}${String(rnd).padStart(2, '0')}`.slice(0, 11);",
          "const razon = `POSTMAN RS ${now}`;",
          "const comercial = `POSTMAN NC ${now}`;",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('ruc_nuevo', ruc);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('razon_social_nueva', razon);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('nombre_comercial_nuevo', comercial);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1) Auth/Login",
      "description": "Objetivo: autenticar usuario QA y obtener JWT | Reglas: credenciales validas deben devolver token utilizable | Exito: status 200/201 y token no vacio | Evidencia: variable auth_header cargada y test Login status",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{usuario}}\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"{{contrasena}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/Auth/Login",
          "host": ["{{base_api}}"],
          "path": ["Auth", "Login"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Login status 200/201', function () { pm.expect([200,201]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "const candidates = [",
              "  data?.token, data?.accessToken, data?.access_token,",
              "  data?.oData?.token, data?.oData?.accessToken, data?.oData?.access_token,",
              "  data?.oData?.jwt",
              "];",
              "const token = candidates.find((v) => typeof v === 'string' && v.trim().length > 0) || '';",
              "pm.test('Token presente', function () { pm.expect(token).to.not.equal(''); });",
              "pm.environment.set('token', token);",
              "pm.environment.set('auth_header', token.startsWith('Bearer ') ? token : `Bearer ${token}`);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2) Entidad/Crear - Exito",
      "description": "Objetivo: registrar entidad nueva | Reglas: RUC y razon social no deben existir para alta limpia | Exito: status 200/201 y bSuccess=true (409 solo si dataset preexistente) | Evidencia: test Creacion exitosa o control de 409",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{auth_header}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}\",\n  \"Ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}\",\n  \"razonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}}\",\n  \"RazonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}}\",\n  \"nombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}}\",\n  \"NombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}}\",\n  \"estado\": 1,\n  \"Estado\": 1,\n  \"idEstado\": 1,\n  \"IdEstado\": 1,\n  \"bitActivo\": true,\n  \"BitActivo\": true\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/Entidad/Crear",
          "host": ["{{base_api}}"],
          "path": ["Entidad", "Crear"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status esperado', function () { pm.expect([200,201,409]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const bSuccess = body?.bSuccess !== false;",
              "if (pm.response.code === 409 || bSuccess === false) {",
              "  pm.test('Permite 409 solo si dataset ya existia', function () { pm.expect(true).to.eql(true); });",
              "} else {",
              "  pm.test('Creacion exitosa', function () { pm.expect(bSuccess).to.eql(true); });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3) Entidad/Crear - RUC duplicado",
      "description": "Objetivo: comprobar control de unicidad por RUC | Reglas: no se permite registrar el mismo RUC dos veces | Exito: status controlado 400/409 o mensaje de duplicidad | Evidencia: test Valida regla RUC duplicado",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{auth_header}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}\",\n  \"Ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}\",\n  \"razonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}} DUP\",\n  \"RazonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}} DUP\",\n  \"nombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}} DUP\",\n  \"NombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}} DUP\",\n  \"estado\": 1,\n  \"Estado\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/Entidad/Crear",
          "host": ["{{base_api}}"],
          "path": ["Entidad", "Crear"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status controlado', function () { pm.expect([200,201,400,409]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const msg = String(body?.sMessage || body?.message || '').toLowerCase();",
              "const duplicated = pm.response.code === 409 || msg.includes('duplic') || msg.includes('existe') || msg.includes('ruc');",
              "pm.test('Valida regla RUC duplicado', function () { pm.expect(duplicated).to.eql(true); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4) Entidad/Crear - Razon social duplicada",
      "description": "Objetivo: comprobar control de duplicidad por razon social | Reglas: razon social no debe repetirse para otra entidad activa | Exito: status controlado 400/409 o mensaje de duplicidad | Evidencia: test Valida regla razon social duplicada",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{auth_header}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}9\",\n  \"Ruc\": \"{{ruc_nuevo}}9\",\n  \"razonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}}\",\n  \"RazonSocial\": \"{{razon_social_nueva}}\",\n  \"nombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}} ZZ\",\n  \"NombreComercial\": \"{{nombre_comercial_nuevo}} ZZ\",\n  \"estado\": 1,\n  \"Estado\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_api}}/Entidad/Crear",
          "host": ["{{base_api}}"],
          "path": ["Entidad", "Crear"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status controlado', function () { pm.expect([200,201,400,409]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const msg = String(body?.sMessage || body?.message || '').toLowerCase();",
              "const duplicated = pm.response.code === 409 || msg.includes('duplic') || msg.includes('existe') || msg.includes('razon');",
              "pm.test('Valida regla razon social duplicada', function () { pm.expect(duplicated).to.eql(true); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
